Package: reprokit
Title: Reproduce and Check Results When Raw Data Cannot be Shared
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("D.M.", "Kloppenburg", , "192165061+dm-k1@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helps authors who cannot share raw data report the sufficient
    statistics that let readers reproduce their results exactly, or decide
    that a few more numbers or the raw data are needed. Helps readers check
    whether reported test statistics are consistent with each other. The output
    lists what readers lose without the raw data, because sharing raw data
    remains the standard.
